-> Loop with index variable

-> Basic index access
colors = ["red", "green", "blue"]
loop color, i over colors get result {
    yield i
}
assert result[0] = 0
assert result[1] = 1
assert result[2] = 2

-> Index used in expression
loop item, idx over [10, 20, 30] get indexed {
    yield item + idx
}
assert indexed[0] = 10
assert indexed[1] = 21
assert indexed[2] = 32
